# Go-To-Market & Launch Checklist
## Marketing & User Acquisition
* Primary Launch Channel: contacting Art student groups on campus, putting up flyers on campus bulletin boards
* Value Proposition: Discover many art museums, exhibitions, artworks nearby and user reviews, all in one platform

## Pre-Launch Deployment Checklist
- Verify all code changes are merged into the 'main' production branch
- Test from submissions (login, search filters, and posting reviews) for basic error handling
- Run a cross-browser usability check (Chrome, Safari, Mobile Screens)
## Launch Day Operations
- Trigger final depolyment to Firebase and check the live production URL
- Conduct live verification testing directly on the hosted platform (test map pins, opening hours, and submitting a test review)
- Share the announcement banner and QR code link across primary marketing channels (campus)
